WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Quantity and unit cost. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Build a transparent parts estimate

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Unit cost divides included costs by the relevant quantity. Allocation choices change the result, so show the basis.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: $560 divided by four units is $140 per unit under the stated example scope.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Spreadsheet-style calculation

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Build a transparent parts estimate
